{"svamajYatiDanaKyayam": [{"id": "svamajYAtiDanAKyAyAm", "headword": "स्वमज्ञातिधनाख्यायाम्", "headword_slp1": "svamajYAtiDanAKyAyAm", "fold": "svamajYatiDanaKyayam", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The word स्व 'own', when it does not mean a kinsman or property is optionally सर्वनाम before the affix जस्।\n\nTerms: सर्वनाम", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["स्वमज्ञातिधनाख्यायाम् १.१.३५", "१.१.३५", "१.१.३५ स्वमज्ञातिधनाख्यायाम्"], "synonyms_slp1": ["svamajYAtiDanAKyAyAm १.१.३५", "१.१.३५", "१.१.३५ svamajYAtiDanAKyAyAm"]}], "svaradinipatamavyayam": [{"id": "svarAdinipAtamavyayam", "headword": "स्वरादिनिपातमव्ययम्", "headword_slp1": "svarAdinipAtamavyayam", "fold": "svaradinipatamavyayam", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The words स्वर् 'heaven' etc. and the particles -- निपात एकाजनाङ् १.४.५६, are called अव्यय or indeclinables.\n\nTerms: अव्यय", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["स्वरादिनिपातमव्ययम् १.१.३७", "१.१.३७", "१.१.३७ स्वरादिनिपातमव्ययम्"], "synonyms_slp1": ["svarAdinipAtamavyayam १.१.३७", "१.१.३७", "१.१.३७ svarAdinipAtamavyayam"]}], "svan rupan sabdasyasabdasanjYa": [{"id": "svaM rUpaM SabdasyASabdasaMjYA", "headword": "स्वं रूपं शब्दस्याशब्दसंज्ञा", "headword_slp1": "svaM rUpaM SabdasyASabdasaMjYA", "fold": "svan rupan sabdasyasabdasanjYa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "In this Grammar, when an operation is directed with regard to a word, the individual form of the word posesssing meaning is to be understood, except with regard to aword which is a definition.\n\nTerms:", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["स्वं रूपं शब्दस्याशब्दसंज्ञा १.१.६८", "१.१.६८", "१.१.६८ स्वं रूपं शब्दस्याशब्दसंज्ञा"], "synonyms_slp1": ["svaM rUpaM SabdasyASabdasaMjYA १.१.६८", "१.१.६८", "१.१.६८ svaM rUpaM SabdasyASabdasaMjYA"]}], "svaritat sanhitayamanudatanam": [{"id": "svaritAt saMhitAyAmanudAttAnAm", "headword": "स्वरितात् संहितायामनुदात्तानाम्", "headword_slp1": "svaritAt saMhitAyAmanudAttAnAm", "fold": "svaritat sanhitayamanudatanam", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The Monotony takes the place of the अनुदात्त vowels which follow the स्वरित vowels, in close proximity (संहिता).\n\nTerms:", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["स्वरितात् संहितायामनुदात्तानाम् १.२.३९", "१.२.३९", "१.२.३९ स्वरितात् संहितायामनुदात्तानाम्"], "synonyms_slp1": ["svaritAt saMhitAyAmanudAttAnAm १.२.३९", "१.२.३९", "१.२.३९ svaritAt saMhitAyAmanudAttAnAm"]}], "svasuraH svasrva": [{"id": "SvaSuraH SvaSrvA", "headword": "श्वशुरः श्वश्र्वा", "headword_slp1": "SvaSuraH SvaSrvA", "fold": "svasuraH svasrva", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The word श्वशुर 'father-in-law', is optionally only retained, when spoken of along with श्वशुरू 'mother-in-law'.\n\nTerms: श्वशुर", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["श्वशुरः श्वश्र्वा १.२.७१", "१.२.७१", "१.२.७१ श्वशुरः श्वश्र्वा"], "synonyms_slp1": ["SvaSuraH SvaSrvA १.२.७१", "१.२.७१", "१.२.७१ SvaSuraH SvaSrvA"]}], "svaritenaDikaraH": [{"id": "svaritenADikAraH", "headword": "स्वरितेनाधिकारः", "headword_slp1": "svaritenADikAraH", "fold": "svaritenaDikaraH", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "In these aphorisms, when a word is marked with a स्वरित accent, by that an अधिकार or a governing rule is to be understood.\n\nTerms: स्वरित", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["स्वरितेनाधिकारः १.३.११", "१.३.११", "१.३.११ स्वरितेनाधिकारः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["svaritenADikAraH १.३.११", "१.३.११", "१.३.११ svaritenADikAraH"]}], "svaritaYitaH kartraBipraye kriyaPale": [{"id": "svaritaYitaH kartraBiprAye kriyAPale", "headword": "स्वरितञितः कर्त्रभिप्राये क्रियाफले", "headword_slp1": "svaritaYitaH kartraBiprAye kriyAPale", "fold": "svaritaYitaH kartraBipraye kriyaPale", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "After the verb marked with a स्वरित or which has an indicatory ञित् , the terminations of the आत्मनेपद are used, when the fruit of the action accrues to the agent.\n\nTerms: आत्मनेपद", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["स्वरितञितः कर्त्रभिप्राये क्रियाफले १.३.७२", "१.३.७२", "१.३.७२ स्वरितञितः कर्त्रभिप्राये क्रियाफले"], "synonyms_slp1": ["svaritaYitaH kartraBiprAye kriyAPale १.३.७२", "१.३.७२", "१.३.७२ svaritaYitaH kartraBiprAye kriyAPale"]}], "svadisvasarvanamasTane": [{"id": "svAdizvasarvanAmasTAne", "headword": "स्वादिष्वसर्वनामस्थाने", "headword_slp1": "svAdizvasarvanAmasTAne", "fold": "svadisvasarvanamasTane", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "When the affixes beginning with a सु ४.१.२ and ending in कप् ५.४.१५१ follow, not being सर्वनामस्थान १.१.४३ then that which precedes is called पद।\n\nTerms: पद संज्ञा", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["स्वादिष्वसर्वनामस्थाने १.४.१७", "१.४.१७", "१.४.१७ स्वादिष्वसर्वनामस्थाने"], "synonyms_slp1": ["svAdizvasarvanAmasTAne १.४.१७", "१.४.१७", "१.४.१७ svAdizvasarvanAmasTAne"]}], "svatantraH karta": [{"id": "svatantraH kartA", "headword": "स्वतन्त्रः कर्ता", "headword_slp1": "svatantraH kartA", "fold": "svatantraH karta", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "Whatever the speaker chooses as the independent, principal and absolute source of action is called कर्ता or agent.\n\nTerms: कारक-कर्म", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["स्वतन्त्रः कर्ता १.४.५४", "१.४.५४", "१.४.५४ स्वतन्त्रः कर्ता"], "synonyms_slp1": ["svatantraH kartA १.४.५४", "१.४.५४", "१.४.५४ svatantraH kartA"]}], "svayan ktena": [{"id": "svayaM ktena", "headword": "स्वयं क्तेन", "headword_slp1": "svayaM ktena", "fold": "svayan ktena", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The indeclinable word स्वयम् 'oneself' is compounded with a word ending in the affix क्त and the resulting compound is तत्-पुरुष ।\n\nTerms: समास-तत्-पुरुष", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["स्वयं क्तेन २.१.२५", "२.१.२५", "२.१.२५ स्वयं क्तेन"], "synonyms_slp1": ["svayaM ktena २.१.२५", "२.१.२५", "२.१.२५ svayaM ktena"]}], "svamisvaraDipatidayadasaksipratiBuprasutEsca": [{"id": "svAmISvarADipatidAyAdasAkzipratiBUprasUtESca", "headword": "स्वामीश्वराधिपतिदायादसाक्षिप्रतिभूप्रसूतैश्च", "headword_slp1": "svAmISvarADipatidAyAdasAkzipratiBUprasUtESca", "fold": "svamisvaraDipatidayadasaksipratiBuprasutEsca", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The 6th and the 7th case-affixes are used after words when they are joined with स्वामिन् 'master', ईश्वर 'lord', अधिपति 'ruler', दायाद 'an heir', साक्षिन् 'witness', प्रतिभू 'a surety' and प्रसूत 'begotten'.\n\nTerms: विभक्ति-6, 7", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["स्वामीश्वराधिपतिदायादसाक्षिप्रतिभूप्रसूतैश्च २.३.३९", "२.३.३९", "२.३.३९ स्वामीश्वराधिपतिदायादसाक्षिप्रतिभूप्रसूतैश्च"], "synonyms_slp1": ["svAmISvarADipatidAyAdasAkzipratiBUprasUtESca २.३.३९", "२.३.३९", "२.३.३९ svAmISvarADipatidAyAdasAkzipratiBUprasUtESca"]}], "svadiByaH snuH": [{"id": "svAdiByaH SnuH", "headword": "स्वादिभ्यः श्नुः", "headword_slp1": "svAdiByaH SnuH", "fold": "svadiByaH snuH", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The affix श्नु comes after the roots of स्वादि class when a सार्वधातुक affix denoting an agent follows.\n\nTerms: श्नु", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["स्वादिभ्यः श्नुः ३.१.७३", "३.१.७३", "३.१.७३ स्वादिभ्यः श्नुः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["svAdiByaH SnuH ३.१.७३", "३.१.७३", "३.१.७३ svAdiByaH SnuH"]}], "svapitfsornajiN": [{"id": "svapitfzornajiN", "headword": "स्वपितृषोर्नजिङ्", "headword_slp1": "svapitfzornajiN", "fold": "svapitfsornajiN", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The affix नजिङ् comes, in the sense of 'agent having such a habit etc.' after the verbs स्वप् 'to sleep' and तृष् 'to be thirsty'.\n\nTerms: नजिङ्", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["स्वपितृषोर्नजिङ् ३.२.१७२", "३.२.१७२", "३.२.१७२ स्वपितृषोर्नजिङ्"], "synonyms_slp1": ["svapitfzornajiN ३.२.१७२", "३.२.१७२", "३.२.१७२ svapitfzornajiN"]}], "svanahasorva": [{"id": "svanahasorvA", "headword": "स्वनहसोर्वा", "headword_slp1": "svanahasorvA", "fold": "svanahasorva", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The affix अप् comes optionally after the verbs 1. स्वन् 2. हस् when no उपसर्ग is in composition with them.\n\nTerms: अप्", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["स्वनहसोर्वा ३.३.६२", "३.३.६२", "३.३.६२ स्वनहसोर्वा"], "synonyms_slp1": ["svanahasorvA ३.३.६२", "३.३.६२", "३.३.६२ svanahasorvA"]}], "svapo nan": [{"id": "svapo nan", "headword": "स्वपो नन्", "headword_slp1": "svapo nan", "fold": "svapo nan", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The affix नन् comes under similar circumstances after the verb स्वप् 'to sleep'.\n\nTerms: नन्", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["स्वपो नन् ३.३.९१", "३.३.९१", "३.३.९१ स्वपो नन्"], "synonyms_slp1": ["svapo nan ३.३.९१", "३.३.९१", "३.३.९१ svapo nan"]}], "svadumi Ramul": [{"id": "svAdumi Ramul", "headword": "स्वादुमि णमुल्", "headword_slp1": "svAdumi Ramul", "fold": "svadumi Ramul", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "(When the actions signified by the verbs कृ 'to make' and another have the same agent), the affix णमुल् is added to the verb कृ 'to make' which is concerned about a time anterior to that of the other), provided that a word signifying 'sweet' is in composition.\n\nTerms: णमुल्", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["स्वादुमि णमुल् ३.४.२६", "३.४.२६", "३.४.२६ स्वादुमि णमुल्"], "synonyms_slp1": ["svAdumi Ramul ३.४.२६", "३.४.२६", "३.४.२६ svAdumi Ramul"]}], "svaNgeDruve": [{"id": "svANge'Druve", "headword": "स्वाङ्गेऽध्रुवे", "headword_slp1": "svANge'Druve", "fold": "svaNgeDruve", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The affix णमुल् comes after a verb when a word in the Accusative -2nd case is in composition, signifying the limbs of one's own body, when the limb is such that its loss will not destroy life.\n\nTerms: णमुल्", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["स्वाङ्गेऽध्रुवे ३.४.५४", "३.४.५४", "३.४.५४ स्वाङ्गेऽध्रुवे"], "synonyms_slp1": ["svANge'Druve ३.४.५४", "३.४.५४", "३.४.५४ svANge'Druve"]}], "svaNge taspratyaye kfBvoH": [{"id": "svANge taspratyaye kfBvoH", "headword": "स्वाङ्गे तस्प्रत्यये कृभ्वोः", "headword_slp1": "svANge taspratyaye kfBvoH", "fold": "svaNge taspratyaye kfBvoH", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The affixes क्तवा and णमुल् are added to the roots कृ 'to make' and भू 'to be', in composition with a word denoting a member of one's own body when the affix तस् is joined thereto.\n\nTerms: क्तवा and णमुल्", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["स्वाङ्गे तस्प्रत्यये कृभ्वोः ३.४.६१", "३.४.६१", "३.४.६१ स्वाङ्गे तस्प्रत्यये कृभ्वोः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["svANge taspratyaye kfBvoH ३.४.६१", "३.४.६१", "३.४.६१ svANge taspratyaye kfBvoH"]}], "svaNgacopasarjanadasanyogopaDat‌": [{"id": "svANgAccopasarjanAdasaMyogopaDAt‌", "headword": "स्वाङ्गाच्चोपसर्जनादसंयोगोपधात्‌", "headword_slp1": "svANgAccopasarjanAdasaMyogopaDAt‌", "fold": "svaNgacopasarjanadasanyogopaDat‌", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "And the feminine affix ङीष् comes optionally after what ends with the name of a part of the body when the word is a subordinate member in compound and has not a conjunct for its penultimate letter (i.e. the final अ is not preceded by a double consonant).\n\nTerms: विभक्ति-ङीष्", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["स्वाङ्गाच्चोपसर्जनादसंयोगोपधात्‌ ४.१.५४", "४.१.५४", "४.१.५४ स्वाङ्गाच्चोपसर्जनादसंयोगोपधात्‌"], "synonyms_slp1": ["svANgAccopasarjanAdasaMyogopaDAt‌ ४.१.५४", "४.१.५४", "४.१.५४ svANgAccopasarjanAdasaMyogopaDAt‌"]}], "svasusCaH": [{"id": "svasuSCaH", "headword": 