he Intensive.\n\nTerms: लिट् लकार", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["स्वपिस्यमिव्येञां यङि ६.१.१९", "६.१.१९", "६.१.१९ स्वपिस्यमिव्येञां यङि"], "synonyms_slp1": ["svapisyamivyeYAM yaNi ६.१.१९", "६.१.१९", "६.१.१९ svapisyamivyeYAM yaNi"]}], "svapadirhinsamacyaniwi": [{"id": "svapAdirhiMsAmacyaniwi", "headword": "स्वपादिर्हिंसामच्यनिटि", "headword_slp1": "svapAdirhiMsAmacyaniwi", "fold": "svapadirhinsamacyaniwi", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The acute accent is optionally on the first syllable when a Personal-ending, being सार्वधातुक tense affix beginning with a vowel, provided that the vowel is not the augment इट् , follows after स्वप् etc., or after हिंस्।\n\nTerms: accent-तिङ्", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["स्वपादिर्हिंसामच्यनिटि ६.१.१८८", "६.१.१८८", "६.१.१८८ स्वपादिर्हिंसामच्यनिटि"], "synonyms_slp1": ["svapAdirhiMsAmacyaniwi ६.१.१८८", "६.१.१८८", "६.१.१८८ svapAdirhiMsAmacyaniwi"]}], "svan svamini": [{"id": "svaM svAmini", "headword": "स्वं स्वामिनि", "headword_slp1": "svaM svAmini", "fold": "svan svamini", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The first member of a तत्-पुरुष समास preserves its original accent when it denotes a thing possessed and when its second term is स्वामिन्।\n\nTerms: तत्-पुरुष समास", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["स्वं स्वामिनि ६.२.१७", "६.२.१७", "६.२.१७ स्वं स्वामिनि"], "synonyms_slp1": ["svaM svAmini ६.२.१७", "६.२.१७", "६.२.१७ svaM svAmini"]}], "svaNgacetomanini": [{"id": "svANgAcceto'mAnini", "headword": "स्वाङ्गाच्चेतोऽमानिनि", "headword_slp1": "svANgAcceto'mAnini", "fold": "svaNgacetomanini", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "A feminine in ई ending in the name of a part of body does not become masculine except the word मानिन् follows.\n\nTerms: Masculisation", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["स्वाङ्गाच्चेतोऽमानिनि ६.३.४०", "६.३.४०", "६.३.४० स्वाङ्गाच्चेतोऽमानिनि"]